<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" version="32.5.5" type="device"><diagram id="architecture" name="Architecture" studioCanvas="{&quot;rootScopeId&quot;:&quot;journey&quot;,&quot;scopes&quot;:{&quot;journey&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;journey&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Business journey&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:0,&quot;purpose&quot;:&quot;A BSA/AML investigator opens an alert or a fraud referral, reviews a cited narrative the investigation agent drafts, decides file or no SAR with a rationale, and a separate QA reviewer approves. E-filing is simulated.&quot;,&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Select the assisted step to explore the system and its components.&quot;,&quot;cellIds&quot;:[&quot;journey::case&quot;,&quot;journey::draft&quot;,&quot;journey::decide&quot;]},&quot;system&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;system&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;System architecture&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:1,&quot;purpose&quot;:&quot;The investigation agent gathers evidence, drafts a cited narrative, and submits it for investigator and QA review.&quot;,&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Open a component for its boundary and controls. Security and Observability add the connected platform services.&quot;,&quot;ownerId&quot;:&quot;journey::draft&quot;,&quot;parentScopeId&quot;:&quot;journey&quot;,&quot;cellIds&quot;:[&quot;system::evidence&quot;,&quot;system::workload&quot;,&quot;system::defense&quot;,&quot;system::observe&quot;,&quot;system::platform.deployment&quot;]},&quot;evidence&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;evidence&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Synthetic case file&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:2,&quot;purpose&quot;:&quot;Four scenarios: money mule linked to the card-fraud ring, structuring, explained activity, and an injection attack. Obviously fake PII. No live core banking.&quot;,&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Select a component for implementation details and available source evidence.&quot;,&quot;ownerId&quot;:&quot;system::evidence&quot;,&quot;parentScopeId&quot;:&quot;system&quot;,&quot;cellIds&quot;:[&quot;evidence::kyc&quot;,&quot;evidence::activity&quot;,&quot;evidence::untrusted&quot;,&quot;evidence::media&quot;,&quot;evidence::handoff&quot;]},&quot;workload&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;workload&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Investigation service&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:2,&quot;purpose&quot;:&quot;The model drafts. Code computes the typologies, verifies every sentence, and enforces the approvals.&quot;,&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Select a component for implementation details and available source evidence.&quot;,&quot;ownerId&quot;:&quot;system::workload&quot;,&quot;parentScopeId&quot;:&quot;system&quot;,&quot;cellIds&quot;:[&quot;workload::agent&quot;,&quot;workload::rules&quot;,&quot;workload::verify&quot;,&quot;workload::review&quot;,&quot;workload::efile&quot;]},&quot;defense&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;defense&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Cisco AI Defense&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:2,&quot;purpose&quot;:&quot;Two placements: untrusted case text before the agent reads it, and every model hop. Typology rules, aggregates, and the verifier never enter Inspection.&quot;,&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Select a component for implementation details and available source evidence.&quot;,&quot;ownerId&quot;:&quot;system::defense&quot;,&quot;parentScopeId&quot;:&quot;system&quot;,&quot;cellIds&quot;:[&quot;defense::segments&quot;,&quot;defense::hops&quot;,&quot;defense::stop&quot;]},&quot;observe&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;observe&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Splunk Agent Observability&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:2,&quot;purpose&quot;:&quot;Only verdict booleans reach Agent Control, never case data. When the controls are not registered the same rules run in-process and are labelled local checks.&quot;,&quot;note&quot;:&quot;Select a component for implementation details and available source evidence.&quot;,&quot;ownerId&quot;:&quot;system::observe&quot;,&quot;parentScopeId&quot;:&quot;system&quot;,&quot;cellIds&quot;:[&quot;observe::controls&quot;,&quot;observe::trace&quot;,&quot;observe::otlp&quot;]},